WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/charging/components/cost-analysis/CostSummaryCards.tsx — the charging cost-analysis "summary
  cards" row. props: { coreStats: CoreStats | null, gasPrice, distanceUnit, isMiles }. Hooks: useTranslation,
  useFormatting (formatCurrency = currencySymbol + fmtNumber), useSettings (gas_unit → 'L'|'gal'; locale; currency).
  Wrapped in <StaggerContainer>; six <StatBox> tiles each in a <StaggerItem>, in a 2/3/6-col responsive grid:
    1 Total Cost    : formatCurrency(totalCost,2)         sub `${fmtInt(count)} sessions`         DollarSign cyan  glow cyan
    2 Avg $/kWh     : formatCurrency(avgCostPerKwh,3)     sub 'blended rate'                      Zap yellow       glow none
    3 Cost Per {u}  : formatCurrency(costPerDist,3)       sub `per ${distanceUnit}`               Car blue         glow none
                      label t('…costPerDist',{unit:isMiles?'Mile':'km','Cost Per {{unit}}'})
    4 Total Energy  : fmtWithUnit(totalEnergy,'kWh',1)    sub fmtWithUnit(gallonsEquiv,'gal equiv',1)  Zap green   glow green
    5 Gas Savings $ : formatCurrency(savings,2)           sub `vs ${formatCurrency(gasPrice,2)}/${gasUnit}` Fuel red glow green
    6 Savings %     : `${fmtNumber(savingsPercent,1)}%`   sub 'vs gasoline'                       TrendingDown emerald glow green
  numberFormat.fmtNumber = safeNumber(v).toLocaleString(locale,{min=max=decimals}); fmtInt = 0dp; fmtWithUnit = "n unit";
  safeNumber → finite|0. coreStats===null → every field falls back to 0 (web `coreStats?.x ?? 0`), so the empty surface
  renders six ZEROED tiles, never em-dash/blank. The prompt's extracted-key list omitted card 3 (its t() uses the object
  form); parity requires all SIX cards — reproduced. Loading/error/stale/offline are owned by the web parent page; this
  native surface re-homes them onto the shared P1/S8 source seam so every prompt-required state renders.

