  icon tint → token : cyan→.accent · yellow→.statusWarning · blue→.chartSeriesSpeed (no theme-adaptive blue token) ·
    green/emerald→.statusSuccess · red→.statusDanger. glow → cyan/.accent · green/.statusSuccess · none/neutral border.
  StaggerContainer/StaggerItem → TSStaggerContainer/TSStaggerItem (Sources/Components/Motion), reduce-motion-honoring.
  useFormatting.formatCurrency / numberFormat.fmtNumber|fmtInt|fmtWithUnit / safeNumber → CostFormat ported 1:1
    (NumberFormatter .halfUp, grouping, min=max=decimals, en-US fallback for blank locale; symbol-prefix currency). Golden
    vectors pinned for en-US AND de-DE (1.234,56 grouping/decimal swap) so every platform shows identical strings.
  i18n      : every string via the P1/S10 facade (NSLocalizedString tableName:"CostSummaryCards", value:<web English>);
              zero English literals in code — even the inline web template literals ("per {u}", "vs {price}/{gasUnit}",
