              reduce-motion honored on the stagger; Dynamic Type via Font.TS roles; monospacedDigit values.
  telemetry : view.opened surface="CostSummaryCards" via CostSummaryCards.surfaceSlug (P1/S11), default OSLog sink, once.

STATES (all render — verified by #Previews + model tests)
  loading  → skeleton chrome (six redacted tiles)                  empty   → six ZEROED tiles + empty hint (web `?? 0`)
